      <h1>Aerosol Manufacturing 101: A Technical Guide to Manufacturing, Formulation, Propellants, and Safety</h1>
      <p><strong>Published on:</strong> 27 November 2025</p>

      <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of Contents">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#industry-overview">Industry Overview</a></li>
          <li><a href="#anatomy">The Anatomy of an Aerosol System</a></li>
          <li><a href="#technical-core">Technical Core: Formulation &amp; Chemistry</a></li>
          <li><a href="#technical-tables">Technical Tables</a></li>
          <li><a href="#safety-regulatory">Safety and Regulatory Compliance</a></li>
          <li><a href="#lab-to-market">From Lab to Market</a></li>
