      <h2 id="safety-regulatory">Safety and Regulatory Compliance</h2>

      <p>Aerosol manufacturing is classified as a high-risk industrial activity due to the combined hazards of flammable gases, pressurized containers, and volatile solvents. As a result, aerosol plants are subject to strict safety and regulatory frameworks.</p>

